{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"thermo-lesson03","version":1,"title":"熱力学","subtitle":"第3回 · 状態関数と完全微分","scope":"熱力学 3.pdf、全11物理ページ。状態関数と完全微分。既存問題と重複する復習と長い証明の再現は出題しない。","sourceManifest":[{"file":"Kyoto_Univ/[2026後期火１]熱力学/熱力学 3.pdf","sha256":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00","pageCount":11,"reviewedPages":[3,4,6,8,9,10],"method":"原資料の抽出テキストと該当ページ画像を確認し、数式・記号・適用条件を照らし合わせた。板書写真は原画像を目視した。"}],"questions":[{"id":"thermo-l03-q01","version":1,"prompt":"内部エネルギーU、熱Q、系が受ける仕事Wのうち、始状態と終状態だけで変化量が決まる状態関数はどれ？","answer":"内部エネルギーU。熱Qと仕事Wは経路による。","criterion":"Uだけが状態関数と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 3.pdf","page":4,"imageKey":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:4"}],"promptHtml":"内部エネルギーU、熱Q、系が受ける仕事Wのうち、始状態と終状態だけで変化量が決まる状態関数はどれ？","answerHtml":"内部エネルギーU。熱Qと仕事Wは経路による。","criterionHtml":"Uだけが状態関数と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l03-q02","version":1,"prompt":"熱力学の準静的過程とは、どのように状態を変える過程？","answer":"各段階で平衡状態とみなせるほど、ゆっくり状態を変える過程。","criterion":"途中の各状態が平衡状態に限りなく近いと言えれば正解。","explanation":"準静的であることだけから可逆とは限らない。","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 3.pdf","page":3,"imageKey":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:3"}],"promptHtml":"熱力学の準静的過程とは、どのように状態を変える過程？","answerHtml":"各段階で平衡状態とみなせるほど、ゆっくり状態を変える過程。","criterionHtml":"途中の各状態が平衡状態に限りなく近いと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":"準静的であることだけから可逆とは限らない。"},{"id":"thermo-l03-q03","version":1,"prompt":"状態関数fの完全微分dfを、同じ状態に戻る閉じた経路に沿って積分すると？","answer":"\\(\\oint df=0\\)。","criterion":"0と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 3.pdf","page":6,"imageKey":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:6"}],"promptHtml":"状態関数fの完全微分dfを、同じ状態に戻る閉じた経路に沿って積分すると？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∮</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\oint df=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"0と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l03-q04","version":1,"prompt":"なめらかな状態関数f(x,y)の全微分dfを、偏微分で表すと？","answer":"\\(df=(\\partial f/\\partial x)_y\\,dx+(\\partial f/\\partial y)_x\\,dy\\)。","criterion":"各変数についての偏微分と、その変数の微小変化の積を足せれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 3.pdf","page":8,"imageKey":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:8"}],"promptHtml":"なめらかな状態関数f(x,y)の全微分dfを、偏微分で表すと？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>x</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">df=(\\partial f/\\partial x)_y\\,dx+(\\partial f/\\partial y)_x\\,dy</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"各変数についての偏微分と、その変数の微小変化の積を足せれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l03-q05","version":1,"prompt":"なめらかな関係f(x,y)を一定に保つ。局所的に逆関数が存在するとき、\\((\\partial x/\\partial y)_f\\)と\\((\\partial y/\\partial x)_f\\)の関係は？","answer":"\\((\\partial x/\\partial y)_f=1/(\\partial y/\\partial x)_f\\)。","criterion":"固定条件を同じにした逆数と言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 3.pdf","page":9,"imageKey":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:9"}],"promptHtml":"なめらかな関係f(x,y)を一定に保つ。局所的に逆関数が存在するとき、<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\partial x/\\partial y)_f</annotation></semantics></math></span>と<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\partial y/\\partial x)_f</annotation></semantics></math></span>の関係は？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>x</mi><msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(\\partial x/\\partial y)_f=1/(\\partial y/\\partial x)_f</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"固定条件を同じにした逆数と言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""},{"id":"thermo-l03-q06","version":1,"prompt":"体積仕事だけをする閉じた系を、一定の外圧pとつり合う始状態から終状態へ移す。吸収熱Qは、H=U+pVを用いてどう表せる？","answer":"\\(Q=\\Delta H\\)。","criterion":"エンタルピーの変化に等しいと言えれば正解。","explanation":"","sources":[{"file":"熱力学 3.pdf","page":10,"imageKey":"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:10"}],"promptHtml":"体積仕事だけをする閉じた系を、一定の外圧pとつり合う始状態から終状態へ移す。吸収熱Qは、H=U+pVを用いてどう表せる？","answerHtml":"<span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q=\\Delta H</annotation></semantics></math></span>。","criterionHtml":"エンタルピーの変化に等しいと言えれば正解。","explanationHtml":""}],"sourceImages":{"730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:4":"./assets/sources/730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00-4.png","730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:3":"./assets/sources/730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00-3.png","730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:6":"./assets/sources/730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00-6.png","730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:8":"./assets/sources/730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00-8.png","730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:9":"./assets/sources/730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00-9.png","730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00:10":"./assets/sources/730efef4f3010fd487b85b3259014fc7bcf63d7e60fe6727e7ed95438327ff00-10.png"},"renderVersion":1}